<title>TURKMENISTAN: Turkmen Jan-Sep industry output rises 25.9 % yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Turkmen Jan-Sep industry output rises 25.9 % yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>ASHGABAT 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkmenistan's industrial output in the first nine months of this year was 25.9 percent higher than in the same 1995 period, the State Statistics Committee said on Monday.</p>
<p>    TURKMEN INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT    Jan-Sept 1996   Jan-Aug 1996</p>
<p>    year-on-year pct change	    +25.9	     +27.5</p>
<p>The committee provided no comparative figures from the previous year.</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
